+// frames, synthetic input events, focus, listener options and custom events.
+// HTML does not order a 0 ms timer against the next animation frame: both orders are valid
+// (Chrome runs the frame first in a visible page). Wait for both callbacks; the microtasks queued
+// by the script must run, in FIFO order, before either. A missing callback fails on the harness
+// timeout.
